  "worked_solution": "Recall that for any random variable $X$ and constant $a,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[aX]={a}^{2}\\cdot \\text{Var}[X].\n$$\n\nIn our case, $a=-\\frac{1}{2}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[-\\frac{1}{2}X] & ={(-\\frac{1}{2})}^{2}\\cdot \\text{Var}[X] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 8 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
